{"id":"662368","name":"蔬菜卷","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/662368/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐皮","amount":"1张"},{"name":"生菜叶","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"丨根"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆芽","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"l棵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生菜叶用开水焯一下捞出备用。","img":"images/662368/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆芽也焯水烫一下捞出来放入凉水里立即捞出备用。","img":"images/662368/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜切丝备用切碎。","img":"images/662368/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放在大盘里。","img":"images/662368/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把一颗鸡蛋一起搅匀。","img":"images/662368/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入面粉。","img":"images/662368/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"、把自制钙粉，花椒粉，盐及香油一起搅匀备用。","img":"images/662368/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"豆腐皮洗净平铺。","img":"images/662368/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把馅料放在上面。","img":"images/662368/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把它们卷紧。","img":"images/662368/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"这个样子。","img":"images/662368/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放在蒸锅上蒸十分钟。","img":"images/662368/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/662368/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切成小段沾调料可以吃了。","img":"images/662368/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"豆芽是自己水裁的，无公害。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}